WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.999 line:0
Seven tiles each, laid on either end of one line;
go out first to score the pips left with the others.

00:00:06.999 --> 00:00:13.999 line:0
The highest double leads: North plays 6-6.

00:00:13.999 --> 00:00:23.998 line:0
Take turns adding to either end;
the touching halves must show the same number.

00:00:23.998 --> 00:00:33.498 line:0
North has no tile that fits
and must draw from the boneyard.

00:00:33.498 --> 00:00:36.998 line:0
The 0-4 fits both ends,
so North taps the end to play on.

00:00:36.998 --> 00:00:50.998 line:0
Fast-forward: East keeps drawing while nothing fits,
and passes once the boneyard is empty.

00:00:50.998 --> 00:01:01.998 line:0
North plays the last tile and the round ends;
East’s remaining tiles are shown.

00:01:01.998 --> 00:01:11.000 line:0
North scores the 56 pips East holds,
reaching this room’s target of 50, and wins.
